DefaultEmailTemplateCollecteContent=<p>Hello,</p><p>To prepare your photovoltaic grid connection request, we need a few details and supporting documents.</p><p>The secure form is quick to complete and helps us submit a clear, complete file without unnecessary back-and-forth.</p><p><a href="__PROCEDURESPV_PUBLIC_COLLECTE_URL__">Complete my connection form</a></p><p>This link is personal and valid for a limited time. If you have any questions, simply reply to this email.</p><p>Best regards,</p>
